    "Id": "chassisdef_falconer_FLC-10R",
    "Name": "Falconer",
    "Details": "The Falconer FLC-10R attempts to address the most common complaint of the FLC-8R, the tendency of its Gauss Rifle to take catastrophic damage, by increasing the amount of effective armor the Mech carries by utilizing Light Ferro-Fibrous armor and dropping one heat sink. While updating the design the lasers were also all upgraded to Extended Range versions.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
